    "text": "Nick Lawrence takes male 75-79 division at Summer Breeze 5K in San Leandro on Aug. 1, 2026\nBy\nB. N. HaagNick Lawrence won the male 75-79 division of the 5K at Summer Breeze in San Leandro, California, on Aug. 1, 2026. He finished in 28:27 and was 50th overall, according to the RunSignUp results.\nHe was listed with a hometown of Berkeley, California.",
